DESCRIPTION:Amnesty's legendary late-night comedy gig is back at the Edinbu
 rgh Fringe! If you've ever looked at the news and thought\, 'this isn't nor
 mal'\, you're not alone. Join hosts Deborah Frances-White (Friday) and Nish
  Kumar (Saturday) with a stellar line-up of talent including Grace Campbell
 \, Larry Dean\, Rosie Jones\, Emmanuel Sonubi\, Abi Clarke and more\, for a
  jam-packed weekend of comedy where every punchline has a purpose. Celebrat
 ing Amnesty International's 65th anniversary and a Fringe tradition spannin
 g more than two decades\, every ticket helps support the fight for human ri
 ghts.\nMore info: https://comedyatlas.app/comedy-atlas/event/stand-up-for-f
 reedom/
